        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, electric bicycle, LiNCM battery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, electric bicycle, LiNCM battery
The data set reflects the replacement of parts for the maintenance of an e-bike of 24kg  with a LiNCM battery. Battery replacement: 1.5 times. Life expectancy battery: 4'000 km.;
UUID: 1df4f5fe-9168-3f70-9f6d-a9b50958edb1
This data sets includes the maintenance of an electric bicycle throughout its life cycle.
Location: Data cover maintenance in Switzerland
Technology: Maintenance of an electric bicycle
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1df4f5fe-9168-3f70-9f6d-a9b50958edb1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
